1
00:00:00,728 --> 00:00:02,898
(Leonard:)And I can't play
because I'm going with her. Right?

2
00:00:03,064 --> 00:00:05,394
Uh, yeah, if you want.
There may not be room.

3
00:00:05,566 --> 00:00:08,526
(Penny:)He's got a lot of stuff, like guitars
and amplifiers.

4
00:00:08,694 --> 00:00:11,444
(Leonard:)Wait. What are you talking about?

5
00:00:11,614 --> 00:00:12,694
(Penny:)My friend Justin.

6
00:00:12,865 --> 00:00:15,655
(Sheldon:)Pay attention, Leonard.
That's why she can't play on Sunday.

7
00:00:15,868 --> 00:00:17,408
(Leonard:)-Who is this Justin?
-Your turn.

8
00:00:17,578 --> 00:00:19,408
(Penny:)-I told you about him.
-Roll the dice.

9
00:00:19,580 --> 00:00:22,040
(Penny:)Yeah. My friend from Omaha,
plays the guitar.

10
00:00:22,208 --> 00:00:23,958
(Penny:)He's coming
looking for session work.

11
00:00:24,126 --> 00:00:26,256
(Penny:)So I told him
he could crash on my couch.

12
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:30,590
Come on. Roll a six, Penny dies horribly
in a nuclear meltdown.

13
00:00:31,550 --> 00:00:34,260
(Sheldon:)See what I mean
when I say the fun is real?

14
00:00:35,096 --> 00:00:38,016
(Leonard:)Hang on. Some guy
is gonna be sleeping on your couch?

15
00:00:38,182 --> 00:00:40,602
(Penny:)He's not some guy. He's my friend.

16
00:00:40,768 --> 00:00:43,898
(Leonard:)So by friend, do you mean
"friend" friend...

17
00:00:44,063 --> 00:00:46,773
...gay friend, or "ex-boyfriend
you're now platonic with...

18
00:00:46,941 --> 00:00:49,361
...but still might have a thing for you"
friend?

19
00:00:49,819 --> 00:00:52,149
(Penny:)Well, he's definitely not gay.

20
00:00:52,321 --> 00:00:56,411
Oh. A definitely-not-gay musician
sleeping on my girlfriend's couch.

21
00:00:56,575 --> 00:00:58,325
Yippie.

22
00:00:58,494 --> 00:01:01,454
(Penny:)Okay, we went out a little bit
a long time ago.

